### Accounts API

@hostname=localhost
@port=5000
@host={{hostname}}:{{port}}
@accessToken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOiIyIiwiaWF0IjoxNzg5Mzg5MDQ2LCJleHAiOjE3ODkzOTI2NDZ9.XtvLqxiwNLddxA2ZlLsLnrpNRCG-glB-uSXomjv_SHw

### Create Account
POST http://{{host}}/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "name": "Mikee Bank",
  "accountType": "bank",
  "initialBalance": "1000.00"
}

### Get All Accounts
GET http://{{host}}/api/accounts?status=archived
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get Account by ID
GET http://{{host}}/api/accounts/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Update Account
PATCH http://{{host}}/api/accounts/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "name": "Mikee Gcash Updated",
  "accountType": "e-wallet",
  "initialBalance": "2000.00"
}

### Update Account Status
PATCH http://{{host}}/api/accounts/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "status": "active"
}

### Close Account
PATCH http://{{host}}/api/accounts/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "status": "closed"
}